  "id": "1305d65c-bf20-4046-8d75-36a8dfcacaa8",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. EvoGS models Gaussian deformation as a temporal evolution process, and the tissue deformation recovery method models tissue geometry and deformation using 3D point and displacement parameters.",
