      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "EvoGS models Gaussian deformation as a time-dependent process and introduces deformation-aware densification for better reconstruction quality.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The tissue deformation recovery method uses 3D point and displacement parameters to describe tissue geometry and deformation.",
